su name review session be series def
prah

su name accept draft to name text decision out be ceremony def
  exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
  ob name sketch out to name decision out be plus do
prah

su name revise draft to name text decision out be ceremony def
  su name better out ob text "Revise the prior answer based on the review." for name author accordingto name review session to name text better out by num 0 be write do
  exists su name decision out ob text "" be text ya
  ob name better out to name decision out be plus do
prah

su name trying ob name text task to name text output be ceremony def
  su name sketch out ob name task for name author accordingto name review session to name text sketch out by num 0 be write do
  su name review out ob text "Review the prior exchange and respond now." for name reviewer accordingto name review session to name text review out by num 0 be write do

  ob name review out from text "PASS" be equally then
  to name text decision out be accept draft do

  ob name review out from text "FAIL" be equally then
  to name text decision out be revise draft do

  su name decision out ret
prah

exists su name trying be export ya
